  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2020 FMCG Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction is an uncommitted, secured revolving working capital facility to support 2020 FMCG Inc. and other borrowing entities (collectively, &#x201c;the Borrowers&#x201d;) who are to design, procure, construct, install, commission and turn-key deliver two non-grid tied solar photovoltaic (&#x201c;PV&#x201d;) power plants, battery energy storage systems and interconnection facilities (each, an &#x201c;Installation&#x201d;) in two remote areas in Guyana (&#x201c;the Project&#x201d;). The locations and systems will be in: (i) Bartica for a 1.5 Mega-Watt peak (&#x201c;MWp&#x201d;) solar PV array plus 0.83MW battery energy storage system (&#x201c;BESS&#x201d;); and (ii) Lethem for a 1MWp solar PV array plus 0.57 MW BESS. The Project will also finance a subsequent set of similar Installations in Guyana.</narrative>
  </description>
